OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies urged to consider
OL,4,Aambulance subscription
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's Ambulance and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fis encouraging parents and carers to
OL,8,F"have a conversation" about taking out
OL,9,Fa subscription to its service.
OL,11,FPeople in the bailiwick have to pay for
OL,12,Fan ambulance if they do not have a
OL,13,Fvalid subscription or medical
OL,14,Finsurance.
OL,16,FWhile a single emergency ambulance
OL,17,Fcall-out costs #610, a child's
OL,18,Fambulance subscription in 2027 is due
OL,19,Fto cost #35 a year, with an adult
OL,20,Fsubscription set at #75 - a small
OL,21,Fincrease from #71 on current fees.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
